@startuml
!include ../themes/proveo.puml
skinparam noteTextAlignment left
' SPEC: _spec/_plans/tutorial-siege-lines.puml
' purpose: live-play-attack-4 — take sieged lines for strong
'   positions; live-play-attack-5 next is openings 3x3
' status: ACTIVE — spec only, no source this turn
'   product = StarChess; latest attack is live-play-attack-3
' covers: apps/starchess/src/tutorial/tutorialScript.config.ts
'         (future live-play-attack-4 siege-lines lesson and
'          live-play-attack-5 openings-tree lesson)
' live spec: _spec/specials/index.puml
'            _spec/packages/starchess-core/scfen-wire.puml
' Notes are capped at 5 lines x 50 columns; one idea per anchor.
'
' Siege lines are sieged-rook lines (S: field plus the
' siegeMode packed-vs-sieged toggle), never a placed or
' drawn object. King-attack-4 guides the player into
' taking those lines for strong positions. King-attack-5
' will be a sample single-player game hinting common
' openings: 3 moves with 3 branches each.
title King Attack 4 — take siege lines;\nKing Attack 5 next: openings 3x3

component "lesson config\nlive-play-attack-4 lines" as CFG <<app>>
component "TutorialScreen\nlive engine + gates" as RUN <<app>>
component "siegedTanks / siegeMode\nstrong positions" as MODE <<app>>
component "live-play-attack-5 openings\n3 moves x 3 branches" as OPEN <<app>>
component "**placed line type**\nengine has none" as LINE <<error>>

CFG ARROW_MAIN RUN
RUN ARROW_MAIN MODE : take sieged lines
RUN ARROW_OPTIONAL OPEN : next game hints
LINE ARROW_ERROR MODE : do not add

note bottom of RUN
  **Guide the player onto sieged lines.**
  Hints mark strong-position squares;
  gates judge the held line, not a
  drawing. King-attack-3 stays last
  until live-play-attack-4 ships.
end note

note bottom of LINE
  **Do not teach the player to draw a
  line, and do not add a line store
  so the backlog title looks true.**
  Placement vs severance is not a
  StarChess verb.
end note

legend bottom
  **Spec only this turn — no source.**
  ==
  live-play-attack-4 takes siege lines;
  live-play-attack-5 hints openings 3x3.
  Diff config when building either.
end legend
@enduml
